&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(監査役会構成員の氏名等)&lt;/h6&gt;
